      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PATSY STONE (3) looks close to another win after finishing third last time (24.32) in a Mix 6/7 at this track. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Leading chance again. VIENNA STORM (2) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Here To Play (24.74) in a T3 RSTW. Chased the leaders and with a clean run can be prominent. Comes through a solid form race last start. Will give a great sight again. LUCKY SPIN (4) was never in contention last time after being shuffled back early at Bendigo, but prior to that won by 2 lengths at this track (24.38) beating Sustainable in a T3 RSTW on August 17. In the mix. MARYVALE GIRL (1) can measure up with the right run.",
